=2 Walkthrough
>**{c=red:Warning:}** **{p:Trust Magic} CANNOT be used in this BCNM.**
* Talk to {n:Leepe-Hoppe} to begin the quest. If the quest {q:Tuning In|Tuning In|Tuning In} is offered (cutscene with {m:Shikaree Y}), simply zone and talk to {n:Leepe-Hoppe} again to get the proper cutscene. Assuming you have the proper fame.
* Next you must battle the six {p:avatar|Avatar} primes to collect their whispers.

\**{c=red:Note:}** Do not return the whispers to the NPC's who allow you access to the {p:avatar|Avatar} prime battles or you will lose them. You can get the whispers again later if you want items from the {p:avatar|Avatar} prime battles.
* Turn the whispers into {n:Leepe-Hoppe} to receive a {@k} {k:Moon bauble}.
* Head to {p:Full Moon Fountain}.
** Preferably, home point to {z:Toraimarai Canal} #1. If you don't have it yet, make sure to grab it on the way. Otherwise, the {p:Survival Guide} can be used to warp to {z:Toraimarai Canal} if you have it.
* With the {@k} {k:Moon bauble} key item in your possession, interact with the fountain to enter the battlefield.
* Defeat {m:Fenrir Prime} and you will receive the {p:key item|Key items}: {@k} {k:Whisper of the moon}.
* Return to {n:Leepe-Hoppe} to turn in the whisper for your reward.

=2 Notes
* Up to 6 party members can enter the arena.
* Each party member must have their own {@k} {k:Moon bauble}.
* Time limit is 30 minutes.
* You can only select **one** of the rewards {n:Leepe-Hoppe} offers at any time.
* You may repeat this quest once per Earth day.
* Once you have completed this quest you can return to {n:Leepe-Hoppe} for another {@k} {k:Moon bauble}. Reobtaining the whispers is not required.
* In order to start this quest, you do not need to have turned in and completed the other "Trial By" Quests, nor do you need to have unlocked the Avatars as a Summoner. Following the advice earlier in this page, you can turn in the whispers to {n:Leepe-Hoppe} first and refight the Avatars again for another set and **then** finish their respective quests, allowing you to complete all the avatar quests and Fenrir in one earth day.

